<title>CROATIA: Croatia March currency reserves rise to $4.28 bln.</title>
<headline>Croatia March currency reserves rise to $4.28 bln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia</p>
<p>issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA CURRENCY RESERVES   MARCH	FEBRUARY    MAR '96</p>
<p> Total (million USD)	  4,283.1     4,181.8     3,538.5</p>
<p> National Bank of Croatia   2,252.4     2,177.8     1,890.8</p>
<p> Commercial banks	     2,033.7     2,014.0     1,647.7</p>
<p>NOTE -- The central bank's reserves rose 3.4 percent in March from February with commercial banks' reserves up 1.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
